Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 23:10:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1144/1265] HERESY 1166: a photograph says whose it is
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «Instrument pictures одобряю. Тримай и апскейли их до
нашего стандартного 1024x1024». A picture someone made (a photograph from
Wikimedia Commons) carries its credit: the overlay shows it under the
picture, «Picture: author · licence · Wikimedia Commons», its page one click
away (the credit kept as data, the tip translated). Two keys in the six
catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
